& [Component]
  + cantor_sop_project is a separate effect-free Rust library depending on cantor_sop_semantics serde and serde_json only
  + capability kernel.sop.project-assemble consumes a strict SuppliedProject value and returns a sealed ProjectAssemblyResult

& [DataFlow]
  + validate project profile package count identifiers namespaces dependency declarations file coordinates logical paths per-file bytes and aggregate bytes
  + translate packages into SnapshotInput package records
  + translate each supplied file into a SourceDocument analyze it with its declared namespace append recovered declarations and retain diagnostics
  + run whole-snapshot semantic validation only when source diagnostics are empty
  + compute domain-separated input snapshot and result digests and validate receipts by deterministic replay

& [Delineation]
  + inside supplied values parsing semantic assembly deterministic identity diagnostics and replay
  + boundary logical paths and source attribution with no host interpretation
  + outside filesystem database query service transport execution provider installation update remote publication and effects

& [EvidenceShape]
  + exact source-custody manifest focused debug/release counts workspace summaries component coordinates and zero-effect counters
  + experiments/cantor_supplied_project_assembly_p0/implementation_evidence_manifest.json binds four artifacts five promoted component files exact workspace totals and all live/effect counters at zero
  + scripts/verify_cantor_supplied_project_assembly_p0_evidence.ps1 independently rehashes every artifact and component coordinate replays custody checks and reruns focused debug and overflow-checked release

& [ObservedResult]
  + multi-package supplied source assembles deterministically independent of package and file order
  + partial source diagnostics remain attributed and noncomplete while semantic validation begins only after source diagnostics clear
  + strict machine forms logical-path and collection bounds duplicate refusal dependency-cycle refusal diagnostic ceilings and replay tamper refusal pass
  + whole cantor_scribe remains held and no filesystem storage query process provider remote or effect authority is present
